      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.4,
          "end": 4.36,
          "en": "It's also worth mentioning",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.36,
          "end": 6.91,
          "en": "that we have alternatives to Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.91,
          "end": 9.97,
          "en": "Vue.js of course, is the focus of this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.97,
          "end": 12.42,
          "en": "and here we will learn all about Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.42,
          "end": 13.78,
          "en": "Vue will turn out to be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.78,
          "end": 17.29,
          "en": "a complete component-based UI framework.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.29,
          "end": 19.92,
          "en": "And you will learn what component-based means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.92,
          "end": 21.82,
          "en": "throughout the course, no worries.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.82,
          "end": 23.64,
          "en": "And it's a framework that includes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.64,
          "end": 25.99,
          "en": "basically all core features you need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.99,
          "end": 28.64,
          "en": "to build modern web applications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.64,
          "end": 31.21,
          "en": "Now you already see that it has one downside,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.21,
          "end": 33.56,
          "en": "and that is that it's a bit less popular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.56,
          "end": 35.63,
          "en": "than React and Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.63,
          "end": 37.92,
          "en": "Now we'll get back to the downside in a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 37.92,
          "end": 41.02,
          "en": "But of course, the first important question is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.02,
          "end": 43.81,
          "en": "what is React and what is Angular?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.81,
          "end": 46.81,
          "en": "Well, React is one Alternative to Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.81,
          "end": 49.51,
          "en": "It's basically also a JavaScript framework,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.51,
          "end": 51.56,
          "en": "though officially, it's just a library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 51.56,
          "end": 54.91,
          "en": "because it has less features than Vue actually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.91,
          "end": 57.4,
          "en": "It only focuses on rendering UIs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.4,
          "end": 60.1,
          "en": "and it misses some features like routing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.1,
          "end": 62.64,
          "en": "which Vue offers out of the box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.64,
          "end": 65.55,
          "en": "You will learn what routing is in this course by the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 65.55,
          "end": 69.2,
          "en": "and therefore React.js is very popular indeed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.2,
          "end": 71.55,
          "en": "But it actually also depends quite a bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 71.55,
          "end": 76.53,
          "en": "on community packages whereas Vue has everything built in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.53,
          "end": 79.07,
          "en": "Now, Angular is yet another Alternative,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.07,
          "end": 81.92,
          "en": "yet another framework which you could use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.92,
          "end": 85.13,
          "en": "and it actually has a bit more features than Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 85.13,
          "end": 87.27,
          "en": "So it helps you with even more problems",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.27,
          "end": 89.01,
          "en": "that you could possibly have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.01,
          "end": 93.55,
          "en": "It's therefore especially popular in the enterprise world,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.55,
          "end": 97.1,
          "en": "though big companies are using all three frameworks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.1,
          "end": 99.39,
          "en": "There are large companies using React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.39,
          "end": 101.75,
          "en": "there are large companies using Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.75,
          "end": 104.4,
          "en": "and there are large companies using Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 104.4,
          "end": 108.39,
          "en": "And like Vue and also like React is component based,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.39,
          "end": 110.37,
          "en": "it actually uses TypeScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.37,
          "end": 113.44,
          "en": "Vue also supports this but it's optional.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.44,
          "end": 115.9,
          "en": "In Angular, it's basically mandatory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.9,
          "end": 117.37,
          "en": "And for smaller projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 117.37,
          "end": 120.07,
          "en": "you could say that Angular could be overkill",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 120.07,
          "end": 121.617,
          "en": "because of all its features,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 121.617,
          "end": 124.14,
          "en": "but of course that always basically comes down",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 124.14,
          "end": 126.75,
          "en": "to personal preference, I would say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 126.75,
          "end": 130.6,
          "en": "In general, all three are very popular and used a lot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 130.6,
          "end": 134.44,
          "en": "Vue is a bit less popular amongst big companies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 134.44,
          "end": 137.6,
          "en": "but there definitely are large companies using it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 137.6,
          "end": 139.77,
          "en": "And attached to this lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 139.77,
          "end": 142.64,
          "en": "you also find a more detailed comparison article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 142.64,
          "end": 144.14,
          "en": "which you can dive into,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 144.14,
          "end": 146.51,
          "en": "though you will get the most out of this article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 146.51,
          "end": 148.56,
          "en": "if you come back to it later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 148.56,
          "end": 150.59,
          "en": "once you learn a bit more about Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 150.59,
          "end": 153.23,
          "en": "For now, it's enough to keep these Alternatives in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 153.23,
          "end": 157.06,
          "en": "and then you can explore them once you know more about Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 157.06,
          "end": 159.01,
          "en": "Because good news also is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 159.01,
          "end": 161.23,
          "en": "that if you ever would want to switch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 161.23,
          "end": 162.67000000000002,
          "en": "to a different alternative,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 162.67000000000002,
          "end": 165.12,
          "en": "once you learned one of these three,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 165.12,
          "end": 167.87,
          "en": "switching will be easier because whilst",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 167.87,
          "end": 170.7,
          "en": "they of course do have different code which you write,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 170.7,
          "end": 173.6,
          "en": "they do have fairly similar concepts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 173.6,
          "end": 176.153,
          "en": "and therefore switching isn't too hard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 177.21699999999998,
          "end": 179.32999999999998,
          "en": "Now these are the Vue Alternatives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 179.32999999999998,
          "end": 182.25,
          "en": "and now that's enough of the theory I would say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 182.25,
          "end": 184.55,
          "en": "Why don't we now simply get started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 184.55,
          "end": 186.16,
          "en": "by writing some Vue code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 186.16,
          "end": 189.763,
          "en": "and getting a first feeling for how Vue works.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
